2261:## D158 · 2026-10-25 · 追查 Ohio 入口并在同一归组流程内对照
2263:- Alex 在 D157 失败后要求「根因是什么」「务必深度的看代码，trace 思考」「再重新尝试是否能解决」。据此重新诊断并做隔离实验，不沿用 D157 的失败配置直接推广。
2264:- 全链路诊断、事前设计与同一验收在 `docs/research/2026-10-25-ohio-root-cause.md`。两臂都使用已修编号 schema、相同连续归组读取和写入；唯一模型差异是把枚举数字的入口段改为先提出重要且可核对的业务问题。没有官方承诺日期时使用明确的研究检查日。仅供实验，默认 role-v5 不变；不增建存储类型或上层 thesis。
2265:- 另修已由原答证明的代码偏差：06 的次年限制针对数字，明确的 event / policy_event 不应被同一年度检查拒绝。其它检查照旧，重放全部范围列出差异。此修复不能解释或解决 Ohio 原答没提出事件的问题，独立报告。
2268:- D158 运行结果：免费重放 326 个答案，事件年度修复仅恢复 NAVER 一条部署事件及三条证据；两个反向修改和完整 211 项测试通过。在线第一条对照请求 180.342 秒超时，无模型回答；其余五个序列未开始，$0.105535 未知用量保留额不释放。新入口尚无在线效果结论，不推广、不自动重发。结果：`poc/reports/2026-10-25-ohio-grouping-02/results.md`。
2270:## D159 · 2026-10-25 · 从抽取到入库重放，先修读取顺序，单独检验身份所需来源
2273:- 八个 v15 库有 834 次日初预抽取，其中 576 次之前已有同日新观点；此数是上下文暴露，不是错误数。删除预抽取，让一条写完下一条再抽，恢复 D31/D63 的顺序要求。D155 中这一顺序修复不再等待分组语义试验；分组仍不因此启用。未完成的旧并行交接明确拒绝恢复，保留原数据，不静默重抽。
2275:- 每个案例每臂三次，最多 24 次请求、$1.50 估算保留额、30 分钟；与 D158 超时请求及其未知费用分开，不自动重发。原文审阅形成的开发预期不是人工金标，结果不充当完整分组验收。前端、Idea、分类、Pull、最终判定和上层论点均不在本次范围。
2280:- Alex 同意 D159 的界限并要求继续完整修复。以同一可核对问题判去重，以同一业务过程判归组；拟议担保改成当年实际付款属于抽取失真，不能强行合并算修复。
2289:- 设计、计数、阅读机制和固定验证见 `docs/research/2026-10-25-extraction-evidence.md`。以 D160 角色为新鲜对照，仅重排并明确证据选择：关键条款及支持/反对理由可归入同一个问题，不因无需新开问题而丢掉。原问题边界、引用检查及存储保持。
2311:- Alex stopped the keyed-views line as Claude had built it overnight, on seeing that the per-object watch list decided what may open: "你这个做法难道不是非常的限死吗？永远都是一堆财务指标，真正的观点呢？", "你现在是写死一些一定需要关注的证据吧？", then "停了吧，codex 再重整呢". The code-owned key (identity: is this the same quantity?) stays; what is worth a thesis is the analyst-model's judgement (00-system: 候选观点是抽取交出去的、已有观点管不到的要紧事). Codex had already recorded the same correction as D155.
2313:- Implementation choices recorded there and settled by Claude: canonical English values live in `src/hivemind/vocabulary.py` and are applied where an answer or a stored record is read for comparison (`extraction.sift`, `matching.check`, `judging._record`, the service's tier counts, the UI adapter), never by rewriting rows; the prompt version is the one switch between the Chinese and English contracts (extraction v6, `matching-v2`, `judging-v3`, `idea-v11`; `poc/config/poc-v17.json`); the Chinese versions keep their request text byte for byte, including the universe's `legacy_name` theme names, so stored requests replay at no cost; `direction` is an enum in the English matching schema; a view's year is stored in one canonical spelling (a fiscal form becomes FY2027 or 2027 for a December year-end, a calendar form 2026, a bare year keeps its digits and is never reinterpreted) so that a waiting dependency joins its year; the half-year filter admits the same questions in both languages; successor orientation and the UI's score orientation read the rungs' numeric bounds first.
2314:- The seed build runs on the 20 NVIDIA documents of 2026-02-25..07-23 with a $5 cap, then the week 2026-07-24..31 and August 1–15 on the same ledger, each stage read before the next; the API and UI are pointed at the English ledger only after that. Grouping stays out of the default pipeline (D149, D162 unchanged).
2318:- Alex, on learning that the grouping research (D142–D150, D156–D162) had not reached the pipeline: "把我要做的grouping逻辑充分地scope in 做第一周管线的验证". Claude put the D149 contract in D147's final form into the default pipeline (`thesis_groups`, `thesis_group_members`, extraction v7 with `group_refs` and `new_groups`, the writer resolving local ids and storing memberships with the theses, matching deciding none), config `poc-v19`.
2319:- The first grouped seed day showed the company-folder failure (eight NVDA financial theses in one "AI infrastructure demand" group) because every candidate had to cite a group. Alex chose the correction from the two offered ("看起来可以你深度思考计划之后改再跑"): a research group is one ongoing matter in the world that several questions track together (a product rollout and its deployments, a financing or acquisition deal, a policy process, an investment or demand cycle), usually across companies and themes; a company's own reported or guided financial lines (total or segment revenue, margins, expenses, tax rate, capex) belong to the company and carry no group unless the line itself tracks such a matter. Code guards it: a declared group is created only when a written thesis that tracks a matter cites it; the lines may join a group another thesis founded. This amends D149's "every proposed thesis carries structured membership" and 06-views' "every candidate needs nonempty references". Config `poc-v20` (`role-v8`).
2321:- Alex's standing note (same day): the pipeline is brute-force LLM prototyping on purpose; it must work and replicate stably before any cost, speed or throughput optimisation.

