     1	"""v4 evidence edges: route claims to premises, judge each pair in isolation.
     2	
     3	Each (premise, claim) pair is judged in its own request that contains only that
     4	thesis/premise and that one piece of evidence (Q9 showed shared context lets
     5	reasons borrow facts from neighbouring edges). Judgments become evaluation
     6	records; they never rewrite the thesis. Jev can be used as the judge through the
